  "description": "Actor Han Jae-hee lives his life driven by a desire to gain recognition from his famous actor father.\n\nOn the very day he resolves to end his life, he ends up making a life-risking contract with a demon named Kissmoor (also known as K), who takes an interest in him.\n\nMeanwhile, due to psychological reasons, Jae-hee struggles with intimacy. In order to film a bed scene, he practices with the demon—who has transformed into the appearance of his co-star, Yoo Sung-woo.\n\nBut because of a misunderstanding on Jae-hee’s part, he ends up getting involved with the \"real\" Yoo Sung-woo as well…\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297062173), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059180), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/morelis_devil), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10194074), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230756)  \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297062166), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059179), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10194062), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230757), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H045018746), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H045018746)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171855)    \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/171854)",
